887
01:42:55.954 --> 01:42:57.954
En dan hebben we die

888
01:42:57.954 --> 01:42:59.954
berg Hermon, in die

889
01:42:59.954 --> 01:43:01.954
psalm 68. Daar is die

890
01:43:01.954 --> 01:43:03.954
tegenstander van God op Gods heilige berg.

891
01:43:04.154 --> 01:43:06.154
