900
01:43:22.154 --> 01:43:24.154
En waarom?

901
01:43:24.154 --> 01:43:26.154
De tegenstander is gewoon kei jaloers.

902
01:43:26.154 --> 01:43:28.154
Hij is

903
01:43:28.154 --> 01:43:30.154
