984
01:46:39.954 --> 01:46:42.954
Zo van David,

985
01:46:42.954 --> 01:46:46.954
u alleen bent,

986
01:46:46.954 --> 01:46:49.954
waardig bevonden,

987
01:46:49.954 --> 01:46:53.954
de zegels te breken.

988
01:46:53.954 --> 01:46:56.954
Leeuw van Juda,

989
01:46:56.954 --> 01:47:00.954
u alleen bent,

990
01:47:00.954 --> 01:47:03.954
waardig bevonden,

991
01:47:03.954 --> 01:47:07.954
de boekrol te openen.

992
01:47:07.954 --> 01:47:10.954
Zo van David,

993
01:47:10.954 --> 01:47:14.954
u alleen bent,

994
01:47:14.954 --> 01:47:17.954
waardig bevonden,

995
01:47:17.954 --> 01:47:21.954
de zegels te breken.

996
01:47:21.954 --> 01:47:24.954
U bent een koning,

997
01:47:24.954 --> 01:47:29.954
u zit op de troon.

998
01:47:33.954 --> 01:47:40.954
Heilen, heilen,

999
01:47:40.954 --> 01:47:44.954
