1001
01:47:51.954 --> 01:47:57.954
waardig boodsevol.

1002
01:48:01.954 --> 01:48:08.954
U bent heilen, heilen,

1003
01:48:08.954 --> 01:48:18.954
ons bieden, op eigen waarde,

1004
01:48:18.954 --> 01:48:24.954
waardig boodsevol.

1005
01:48:29.954 --> 01:48:30.954
Amen.

1006
01:48:31.954 --> 01:48:34.954
Weet je, niets wat in de Bijbel staat,

1007
01:48:34.954 --> 01:48:37.954
